#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md:36
#: 848a665c692c417b9cbb7fc97b277245
msgid ""
"Operators and `ros2_robot_interface` send those same integers on "
"**`/fsm_command`** (`std_msgs/Int32`). That is the stack-wide FSM topic —"
" [FSM and Topics](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md). Joystick "
"`control_input` (`arms_ros2_control_msgs/Inputs`) on "
"`arms_target_manager` is a different message, scaled into "
"`/left_target/twist`."
msgstr ""
"操作员与 `ros2_robot_interface` 把同样的整数发到 "
"**`/fsm_command`**（`std_msgs/Int32`）。这才是全栈 FSM "
"话题——[状态机与话题](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md)。`arms_target_manager` "
"上的手柄 `control_input`（`arms_ros2_control_msgs/Inputs`）是另一种消息，按比例映射到 "
"`/left_target/twist`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md:38
#: ed4de08a92944b0fb02bd0c743bef0b9
msgid ""
"`arms_controller_common` also implements **MoveJ** (`StateMoveJ`) and "
"`FSMCommandPublisher`, which publishes **`std_msgs/Int32`** on "
"`/fsm_command` (values in that header: `1` HOME, `2` HOLD, `3` OCS2, `4` "
"MOVEJ). On mixed OCS2/WBC stacks, `basic_joint_controller` treats `3` and"
" `4` as MOVEJ, while this controller treats `3` as OCS2 and `4` as MOVEJ "
"— see [basic_joint_controller](7-basic_joint_controller.md)."
msgstr ""
"`arms_controller_common` 还实现了 **MoveJ**（`StateMoveJ`）和 "
"`FSMCommandPublisher`，后者向 `/fsm_command` 发布 "
"**`std_msgs/Int32`**（头文件取值：`1` HOME、`2` HOLD、`3` OCS2、`4` MOVEJ）。混合 "
"OCS2/WBC 栈上，`basic_joint_controller` 把 `3` 和 `4` 当作 MOVEJ，而本控制器把 `3` 当作 "
"OCS2、`4` 当作 MOVEJ——见 "
"[basic_joint_controller](7-basic_joint_controller.md)。"

