msgid ""
"Body and head: `basic_joint_controller` (`setup_body_controllers` for "
"`body` and `head`, e.g. `body_joint_controller`)"
msgstr ""
"身体和头部：`basic_joint_controller`（`setup_body_controllers` 处理 `body` 与 "
"`head`，例如 `body_joint_controller`）"

